		</aside></div><div class="sidebar footer-sidebar col-md-4 col-sm-12"><aside id="text-14" class="widget widget_text"><h4 class="widget-title"><span>About ISGH</span></h4>			<div class="textwidget"><p>The Islamic Society of Greater Houston is one of the largest Islamic organizations in North America. It was established in 1969 in the heart of Houston, Texas and currently includes 22 Islamic Centers. Our aim is to serve the Muslims of Houston and, along with other faith based communities, be a beacon of light to illuminate and serve our city. Visit the <a style="color: #10b765;" href="https://isgh.org/about">About page</a> for more. ISGH is a non-profit 501(c)(3) organization that is registered in the State of Texas.</p>
